" srcSet="https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=600%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/AcwPxCcdvaRH_MRm0b7oc926K_1440x959.jpg 600w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=770%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/AcwPxCcdvaRH_MRm0b7oc926K_1440x959.jpg 770w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1000%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/AcwPxCcdvaRH_MRm0b7oc926K_1440x959.jpg 1000w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1248%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/AcwPxCcdvaRH_MRm0b7oc926K_1440x959.jpg 1248w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1440%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/AcwPxCcdvaRH_MRm0b7oc926K_1440x959.jpg 1440w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/AcwPxCcdvaRH_MRm0b7oc926K_1440x959.jpg 1920w" src="https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/AcwPxCcdvaRH_MRm0b7oc926K_1440x959.jpg"/></noscript></span></div></div><figcaption><span class="LiveBlogs_ImageCaption__WXzt7"> </span><span class="LiveBlogs_ImageCredit__DYVtG" style="padding-bottom:0">Getty Images</span></figcaption></figure><div id="liveblog-post-content" class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogBody__9bgXM LiveBlogs_PostBody__HX1FM"><p>Jason Jones gave <strong>Mike Brown</strong> a wonderful and well-deserved shoutout earlier, and I think it’s also worth mentioning that not only has Brown responded to his exile from Sacramento becoming the coach who got the Knicks back to the NBA Finals — but his former starting point guard, <strong>De’Aaron Fox</strong>, is two wins away from meeting him there. </p><p>Long live the 2023 Kings.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div class="Skeleton_Base__iFcM1 Pickem_PickemSkeleton__5HAyM" style="height:220px"></div><section class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogContentSection__5VgoG"><div class="Fade_Base__oC3XN Fade_FadeIn__BlL3J" style="--fade-duration:1000ms"><div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostContainer__gp4u6 LiveBlogs_BottomBorder__SPKpV"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp LiveBlogs_addMargin__OI4_i"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostBylineContainer__GCAVS"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp post-header-link"><div class="Avatar_Base__PEyFI styled-image-with-fallback" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;width:40px;height:40px"><div class="image" style="position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;visibility:hidden"><div class="Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2740%27%20height=%2740%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Michael Bailey" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><noscript><img alt="Michael Bailey" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-