</div></div></div></div></div></section><div data-live-blog-ad-slot="true" class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogAdSlot__v90mV"><div class="ad-wrapper no-margin-ad"><a href="#after-mid0-2-ad" class="skip-link">SKIP ADVERTISEMENT</a><div class="ad-slug-container"><p class="slug ad-slug">Advertisement</p></div><div id="mid0-2" data-position="mid0-2" class="ad"></div><div id="after-mid0-2-ad" tabindex="-1"></div></div></div><section class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogContentSection__5VgoG"><div class="Fade_Base__oC3XN Fade_FadeIn__BlL3J" style="--fade-duration:1000ms"><div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostContainer__gp4u6 LiveBlogs_BottomBorder__SPKpV"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostBylineContainer__GCAVS"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp post-header-link"><div class="Avatar_Base__PEyFI styled-image-with-fallback" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;width:40px;height:40px"><div class="image" style="position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;visibility:hidden"><div class="Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2740%27%20height=%2740%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="James L. Edwards III" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><noscript><img alt="James L. Edwards III" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover" class="image-next-root" srcSet="https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2018/03/06200857/James-L.-Edwards-III.jpg?width=48&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp 1x, https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2018/03/06200857/James-L.-Edwards-III.jpg?width=96&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp 2x" src="https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2018/03/06200857/James-L.-Edwards-III.jpg?width=96&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp"/></noscript></span></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostMeta__he7PA"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogNonRelativeTimestamp__K8_LD LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostTimestamp__7iB7e"><time dateTime="2026-05-26T04:15:30.000Z">May 26, 2026<!-- --> at 12:15 AM<!-- --> EDT</time></div><div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostByline___riv_"><span class="nowrap">James L. Edwards III</span><span>·</span><span><div class="LineClamp_LineClamp__OYTvW" style="-webkit-line-clamp:1">Staff Writer, Knicks reporting from Rocket Arena</div></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostActions__3TiJu"><div role="button" tabindex="0" style="cursor:pointer;display:inline-block" aria-label="Copy to Clipboard"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostLinkImage__9XocL post-link Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2730%27%20height=%2730%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/></span></div></div></div></div><h2 class="LiveBlogs_PostTitle__v911d">Takeaways: Can Knicks do this vs. Thunder or Spurs?</h2><div id="liveblog-post-content" class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogBody__9bgXM LiveBlogs_PostBody__HX1FM"><p>New York’s dominant run has made the franchise feel invincible. The Knicks dropped the first two of three games to the Hawks in the first round and have been on as dominant a postseason run as there has been in NBA history. They go into the NBA Finals having won 11 straight playoff games.</p><p>As far as confidence goes, New York has plenty of it going into the sport’s most prestigious stage. They’ll need all the confidence they can get. The Knicks can beat either Oklahoma City or San Antonio, but it won’t be as easy as their path in the Eastern Conference has made it seem.</p><p>Neither the Thunder nor the Spurs has anyone in their starting lineup that the Knicks can hunt defensively. The Hawks had<strong> CJ McCollum</strong> and <strong>Jalen Johnson</strong>. The 76ers had <strong>Joel Embiid</strong> and <strong>Tyrese Maxey.</strong> The Cleveland Cavaliers had <strong>James Harden</strong> and <strong>Donovan Mitchell</strong>.</p><p>New York’s potent offense is going to come back to a more realistic ground in the NBA Finals but it has the defense, just like whichever team it will face next, to make up for the inevitable drop off.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogContentSection__5VgoG"><div class="Fade_Base__oC3XN Fade_FadeIn__BlL3J" style="--fade-duration:1000ms"><div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostContainer__gp4u6 LiveBlogs_BottomBorder__SPKpV"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostBylineContainer__GCAVS"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp post-header-link"><div class="Avatar_Base__PEyFI styled-image-with-fallback" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;width:40px;height:40px"><div class="image" style="position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;visibility:hidden"><div class="Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2740%27%20height=%2740%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Jason Lloyd" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><noscript><img alt="Jason Lloyd" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover" class="image-next-root" srcSet="https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2020/04/14194557/HS_Square_0050_20200227Lloyd-Jason0364_bw.jpg?width=48&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp 1x, https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2020/04/14194557/HS_Square_0050_20200227Lloyd-Jason0364_bw.jpg?width=96&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp 2x" src="https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2020/04/14194557/HS_Square_0050_20200227Lloyd-Jason0364_bw.jpg?width=96&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp"/></noscript></span></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostMeta__he7PA"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogNonRelativeTimestamp__K8_LD LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostTimestamp__7iB7e"><time dateTime="2026-05-26T04:10:18.000Z">May 26, 2026<!-- --> at 12:10 AM<!-- --> EDT</time></div><div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostByline___riv_"><span class="nowrap">Jason Lloyd</span><span>·</span><span><div class="LineClamp_LineClamp__OYTvW" style="-webkit-line-clamp:1">Senior Columnist reporting from Rocket Arena</div></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostActions__3TiJu"><div role="button" tabindex="0" style="cursor:pointer;display:inline-block" aria-label="Copy to Clipboard"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostLinkImage__9XocL post-link Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2730%27%20height=%2730%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/></span></div></div></div></div><h2 class="LiveBlogs_PostTitle__v911d">Takeaways: The Cavs quit</h2><figure style="margin:0"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogImageContainer__nB2uM"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogImage__QNL1Y"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;padding-top:66.59722222222221%"></span><img alt="Takeaways: The Cavs quit" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="responsive" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/><noscript><img alt="Takeaways: The Cavs quit" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="responsive" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%" class="image-next-root" sizes="
  (max-width: 600px) 90vw,
  (max-width: 700px) 100vw,
  700px
" srcSet="https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=600%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/Ij9PtNPHsu9v_WE8O6UlUgW9w_1440x959.jpg 600w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=770%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/Ij9PtNPHsu9v_WE8O6UlUgW9w_1440x959.jpg 770w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1000%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/Ij9PtNPHsu9v_WE8O6UlUgW9w_1440x959.jpg 1000w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1248%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/Ij9PtNPHsu9v_WE8O6UlUgW9w_1440x959.jpg 1248w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1440%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/Ij9PtNPHsu9v_WE8O6UlUgW9w_1440x959.jpg 1440w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/Ij9PtNPHsu9v_WE8O6UlUgW9w_1440x959.jpg 1920w" src="https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/Ij9PtNPHsu9v_WE8O6UlUgW9w_1440x959.jpg"/></noscript></span></div></div><figcaption><span class="LiveBlogs_ImageCaption__WXzt7"> </span><span class="LiveBlogs_ImageCredit__DYVtG" style="padding-bottom:0">Imagn Images</span></figcaption></figure><div id="liveblog-post-content" class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogBody__9bgXM LiveBlogs_PostBody__HX1FM"><p>The final image of the 2025-26 <strong>Cleveland Cavaliers</strong> will be the team giving up at the end of Game 3 and fans of the New York Knicks storming their arena for an embarrassing Game 4.</p><p>Making the conference finals is a noteworthy accomplishment for a franchise that for years couldn’t make it out of the second round, but the Cavs’ performance in this series was disastrous. </p><p>Cleveland ended its season by playing 14 games in 27 days and coach Kenny Atkinson spent most of this series talking about fatigue and how tired his players were. Certainly, it played a role in how lopsided this series was — but that can’t be the excuse.</p><p>Something has to change. But what? </p><p>The Cavs are boxed in by their payroll and previous roster decisions. Nevertheless, the unvarnished truth is the team with the league’s highest payroll quit on their own floor to end their season. </p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogContentSection__5VgoG"><div class="Fade_Base__oC3XN Fade_FadeIn__BlL3J" style="--fade-duration:1000ms"><div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostContainer__gp4u6 LiveBlogs_BottomBorder__SPKpV"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostBylineContainer__GCAVS"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp post-header-link"><div class="Avatar_Base__PEyFI styled-image-with-fallback" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;width:40px;height:40px"><div class="image" style="position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;visibility:hidden"><div class="Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2740%27%20height=%2740%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Fred Katz" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position: