ative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2730%27%20height=%2730%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/></span></div></div></div></div><h2 class="LiveBlogs_PostTitle__v911d">Takeaways: Towns proves he’s a winner</h2><figure style="margin:0"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogImageContainer__nB2uM"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogImage__QNL1Y"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;padding-top:66.66666666666666%"></span><img alt="Takeaways: Towns proves he’s a winner" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="responsive" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/><noscript><img alt="Takeaways: Towns proves he’s a winner" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="responsive" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%" class="image-next-root" sizes="
  (max-width: 600px) 90vw,
  (max-width: 700px) 100vw,
  700px
" srcSet="https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=600%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/xknIbjR5hz5U_esX55nKjLqv0_1440x960.jpg 600w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=770%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/xknIbjR5hz5U_esX55nKjLqv0_1440x960.jpg 770w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1000%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/xknIbjR5hz5U_esX55nKjLqv0_1440x960.jpg 1000w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1248%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/xknIbjR5hz5U_esX55nKjLqv0_1440x960.jpg 1248w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1440%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/xknIbjR5hz5U_esX55nKjLqv0_1440x960.jpg 1440w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/xknIbjR5hz5U_esX55nKjLqv0_1440x960.jpg 1920w" src="https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/xknIbjR5hz5U_esX55nKjLqv0_1440x960.jpg"/></noscript></span></div></div><figcaption><span class="LiveBlogs_ImageCaption__WXzt7"> </span><span class="LiveBlogs_ImageCredit__DYVtG" style="padding-bottom:0">Imagn Images</span></figcaption></figure><div id="liveblog-post-content" class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogBody__9bgXM LiveBlogs_PostBody__HX1FM"><p><strong>Karl-Anthony Towns</strong> took 11 shots and yet, no one will sit here to complain about his lack of involvement. </p><p>The Knicks wrecked the Cavaliers because of his — as he and Mike Brown have put it — “sacrifice.” Towns isn’t shooting as much. He continues to score efficiently. His passing is through the roof. And it’s transformed the Knicks offense in the process.</p><p>For all the flak Towns gets about not being a malleable enough player, he continues to win. This is his third consecutive conference finals appearance, the first with the Minnesota Timberwolves and the last two with the Knicks. </p><p>Now, he’s on the way to the NBA Finals for the first time.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogContentSection__5VgoG"><div class="Fade_Base__oC3XN Fade_FadeIn__BlL3J" style="--fade-duration:1000ms"><div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostContainer__gp4u6 LiveBlogs_BottomBorder__SPKpV"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp LiveBlogs_addMargin__OI4_i"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostBylineContainer__GCAVS"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp post-header-link"><div class="Avatar_Base__PEyFI Avatar_Bordered__mhAya styled-image-with-fallback" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;border-color:#f0f0ee"><div class="image" style="position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;visibility:hidden"><div class="Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2740%27%20height=%2740%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Esfandiar Baraheni" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><noscript><img alt="Esfandiar Baraheni" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover" class="image-next-root" srcSet="https://cdn.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=48%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn.theathletic.com/app/uploads/2016/07/08183138/ta_avatar.png 1x, https://cdn.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=96%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn.theathletic.com/app/uploads/2016/07/08183138/ta_avatar.png 2x" src="https://cdn.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=96%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn.theathletic.com/app/uploads/2016/07/08183138/ta_avatar.png"/></noscript></span></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostMeta__he7PA"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogNonRelativeTimestamp__K8_LD LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostTimestamp__7iB7e"><time dateTime="2026-05-26T03:59:00.000Z">May 25, 2026<!-- --> at 11:59 PM<!-- --> EDT</time></div><div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostByline___riv_"><span class="nowrap">Esfandiar Baraheni</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostActions__3TiJu"><div role="button" tabindex="0" style="cursor:pointer;display:inline-block" aria-label="Copy to Clipboard"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostLinkImage__9XocL post-link Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2730%27%20height=%2730%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/></span></div></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogVideoContainer___Hitd"><div class="AspectRatioBox_root__AKv5b" style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9;max-height:min(100%)"><div class="AspectRatioBox_inner__86C_2" style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9"><div class="VideoStreamPlayer_GridStack__2H0p2"></div></div></div></div><div id="liveblog-post-content" class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogBody__9bgXM LiveBlogs_PostBody__HX1FM"><p>Small guards aren’t supposed to be able to win in the modern NBA.</p><p>But <strong>Jalen Brunson </strong>keeps creating his own legacy. </p><p>Watch my video on the Knicks’ star. </p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogContentSection__5VgoG"><div class="Fade_Base__oC3XN Fade_FadeIn__BlL3J" style="--fade-duration:1000ms"><div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostContainer__gp4u6"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostBylineContainer__GCAVS"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp post-header-link"><div class="Avatar_Base__PEyFI styled-image-with-fallback" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;width:40px;height:40px"><div class="image" style="position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;visibility:hidden"><div class="Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;ov