;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/></span></div></div></div></div><h2 class="LiveBlogs_PostTitle__v911d">2026 Knicks similar to 1970s</h2><figure style="margin:0"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogImageContainer__nB2uM"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogImage__QNL1Y"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;padding-top:66.66666666666666%"></span><img alt="2026 Knicks similar to 1970s" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="responsive" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/><noscript><img alt="2026 Knicks similar to 1970s" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="responsive" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%" class="image-next-root" sizes="
  (max-width: 600px) 90vw,
  (max-width: 700px) 100vw,
  700px
" srcSet="https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=600%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/qr1QUbPztuON_qGXsg84OpZgQ_1440x960.jpg 600w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=770%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/qr1QUbPztuON_qGXsg84OpZgQ_1440x960.jpg 770w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1000%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/qr1QUbPztuON_qGXsg84OpZgQ_1440x960.jpg 1000w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1248%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/qr1QUbPztuON_qGXsg84OpZgQ_1440x960.jpg 1248w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1440%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/qr1QUbPztuON_qGXsg84OpZgQ_1440x960.jpg 1440w, https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/qr1QUbPztuON_qGXsg84OpZgQ_1440x960.jpg 1920w" src="https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920%2cquality=70%2cformat=auto/https://cdn-media.theathletic.com/qr1QUbPztuON_qGXsg84OpZgQ_1440x960.jpg"/></noscript></span></div></div><figcaption><span class="LiveBlogs_ImageCaption__WXzt7"> </span><span class="LiveBlogs_ImageCredit__DYVtG" style="padding-bottom:0">Getty Images</span></figcaption></figure><div id="liveblog-post-content" class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogBody__9bgXM LiveBlogs_PostBody__HX1FM"><p>New York fell in love with the 1970-73 Knicks because of their likability … in how they played and how they carried themselves. </p><p>Brunson, KAT, Hart, Bridges, OG, Mike Brown, Shamet etc — they have that quality. </p><p>Important part of this historic return to the NBA Finals.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogContentSection__5VgoG"><div class="Fade_Base__oC3XN Fade_FadeIn__BlL3J" style="--fade-duration:1000ms"><div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostContainer__gp4u6 LiveBlogs_BottomBorder__SPKpV"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostBylineContainer__GCAVS"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp post-header-link"><div class="Avatar_Base__PEyFI styled-image-with-fallback" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;width:40px;height:40px"><div class="image" style="position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;visibility:hidden"><div class="Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2740%27%20height=%2740%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Mike Prada" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><noscript><img alt="Mike Prada" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover" class="image-next-root" srcSet="https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2026/05/18112010/Prada-Mike-Headshot-051726.jpg?width=48&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp 1x, https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2026/05/18112010/Prada-Mike-Headshot-051726.jpg?width=96&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp 2x" src="https://static01.nyt.com/athletic/uploads/wp/2026/05/18112010/Prada-Mike-Headshot-051726.jpg?width=96&amp;quality=70&amp;auto=webp"/></noscript></span></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostMeta__he7PA"><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogNonRelativeTimestamp__K8_LD LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostTimestamp__7iB7e"><time dateTime="2026-05-26T03:35:00.000Z">May 25, 2026<!-- --> at 11:35 PM<!-- --> EDT</time></div><div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostByline___riv_"><span class="nowrap">Mike Prada</span><span>·</span><span><div class="LineClamp_LineClamp__OYTvW" style="-webkit-line-clamp:1">Senior Editor, NBA</div></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="LiveBlogs_PostActions__3TiJu"><div role="button" tabindex="0" style="cursor:pointer;display:inline-block" aria-label="Copy to Clipboard"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostLinkImage__9XocL post-link Image_Root--centered__66MeR"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%2730%27%20height=%2730%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="image-next-root" style="border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/></span></div></div></div></div><h2 class="LiveBlogs_PostTitle__v911d">Looking ahead to the Finals</h2><div id="liveblog-post-content" class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogBody__9bgXM LiveBlogs_PostBody__HX1FM"><p>The Knicks have not beaten the Thunder since Nov. 21, 2022. The Thunder’s starters in that game: Shai Gilgeous-Alexander, Lu Dort, Josh Giddey, Kenrich Williams and Jeremiah Robinson-Earl. That’s historically been a rough matchup for New York.</p><p>They did, however, play the Spurs well this season, beating them in the NBA Cup final and smashing them at Madison Square Garden on March 1 by 25 points. That was one of four regular-season losses the Spurs had after Feb. 1; two of the other three were nailbiters to Denver, while the third was in the season finale when the Spurs rested their key players.</p><p>The Spurs beat the Knicks in late December, but only by two points and only because Julian Champagnie hit 11 3s.</p><p>So if you’re a Knicks fan hoping for a title, I’d recommend rooting for the Spurs in the West finals.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogContentSection__5VgoG"><div class="Fade_Base__oC3XN Fade_FadeIn__BlL3J" style="--fade-duration:1000ms"><div><div class="LiveBlogs_LiveBlogPostContainer__gp4u6 LiveBlogs_BottomBorder__SPKpV"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp LiveBlogs_addMargin__OI4_i"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostBylineContainer__GCAVS"><div class="LiveBlogs_PostHeader__HRJXp post-header-link"><div class="Avatar_Base__PEyFI styled-image-with-fallback" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;width:40px;height:40px"><div class="image" style="position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;visibility:hidden"><div class="Image_Root--centere